            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is in combat, it can move 12&quot;. It can pass through the combat ranges of enemy units but cannot end that move in combat. Then, roll a D3 for each enemy unit that this unit passed across during that move. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on that enemy unit equal to the roll.</characteristic>
