                          </conditions>
                        </conditionGroup>
                      </conditionGroups>
                    </modifier>
                  </modifiers>
                  <rules>
                    <rule name="Cauldron of Blood" id="6742-bdf1-08f3-bc3e" hidden="true">
                      <description>**Champion of the Arena** or **Priestess of Khaine** only.  Add the **Guardians&apos; Blades** and **Avatar&apos;s Sword** weapons to your hero&apos;s warscroll. 
In addition, make the following changes to your hero&apos;s warscroll:
• Change the Health characteristic to 12.
• Change the Save characteristic to 4+.
• Change the Control characteristic to 5.
• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^War Machine^^** keyword.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
            </selectionEntryGroup>
