          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit is not in combat, pick a visible enemy **^^Infantry^^** or **^^Cavalry Hero^^** that has no more than 1 model and is within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the target is more than 3&quot; from all other enemy units, apply the effect below. Otherwise, roll a dice. On a 3+, apply the effect below. 
